From 1dcd1dff66b3fe4d697355268b1e468d89591405 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: widescopeindustries <lyndon@widescopeindustries.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Nov 2025 02:14:02 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Revamp homepage with trust-first narrative and separate
 installer funnel
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Restructure homepage to lead with homeowner protection instead of installer pitch:
- New "Don't Become a Solar Victim" hero with crisis stats (100+ bankruptcies, Sunnova)
- Veteran-owned positioning and mission statement
- 3-point vetting process explanation (Insurance, Licensing, Financial Health)
- "Not Another EnergySage Clone" differentiation section
- Clean transition to 3 equal CTAs (Browse Installers, Learn Solar, Get Quote)
- Featured installers section moved lower (social proof only)

Separate installer funnel completely from consumer experience:
- Subtle "For Installers" link in header (small, muted text)
- "Become a Verified Installer" link in footer "Partners" section
- New /for-installers page with minimal contact form only
- All installer sales pitch moved offline to email/sales team
- Result: 100% consumer-focused public site, zero perceived bias

Add Solar Safety Scored badge asset to public folder

🧠 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
